  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI3152-M5-BASELINE-EVIDENCE-GAP" ;
  triage:title "M5 benchmark artifacts lack a diffable pre-regression baseline" ;
  triage:description "None of the committed UDS benchmark artifacts populate a distinct pre-regression baseline (comparison_source_revision / thresholds.baseline_median_admissions_per_second are null in most runs). The internal comparison compares a run against its own same-session f1 median, not a stored pre-67fc2e80 artifact. Raw absolute throughput (15.6k-22.1k/s) supports recovery but there's no directly-diffable before/after artifact pair. Evidence-completeness gap, not fabrication." ;
